BT /F1 10 Tf 54 567 Td (   to hold this limit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (- CFO limit now covers \24350,000 to \243250,000; CEO limit now covers \243250,000 to \2431,000,000.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 541 Td (- Capital Expenditure Request \(F-420\) now required for capex over \2432,500 \(previously) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 528 Td (   \2431,000\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 515 Td (- Contract signature threshold aligned with the Procurement Manual.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 502 Td (- Budget exchange rates updated for FY2025/26.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 486 Td (1. Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 464 Td (This policy sets out who may commit Meridian Instruments Ltd and its subsidiaries to spending,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 451 Td (contracts and capital investment, and up to what value. It ensures that significant decisions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 438 Td (receive the right level of scrutiny, and that no single person can both initiate and approve a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 425 Td (commitment.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 400 Td (2. Scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 378 Td (The matrix applies to all Meridian entities: Meridian Instruments Ltd \(Leeds\), Meridian) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 365 Td (Instruments B.V. \(Rotterdam\), Meridian Instruments Inc. \(Austin\) and Meridian Instruments Sdn.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 352 Td (Bhd. \(Penang\). It covers operating expenditure, purchase requisitions, capital expenditure,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 339 Td (contracts and write-offs. Employee travel and expense claims are approved under the Travel and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 326 Td (Expense Policy \(POL-FIN-007\), and corporate card spend under the Corporate Card Policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 313 Td (\(POL-FIN-009\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 288 Td (3. Principles) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 266 Td (- Approval limits apply to the total value of the commitment over its full life, including) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 253 Td (   all years of a multi-year contract, excluding VAT or sales tax.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 240 Td (- Commitments must not be split to fall under a lower approval limit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 227 Td (- An approver may not approve a commitment from which they personally benefit, or one they) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 214 Td (   have raised themselves.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 201 Td (- Approvers may only approve spend against cost centres for which they are responsible, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 188 Td (   higher-level approvers above them in the hierarchy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 175 Td (- Delegation of an approval limit during absence must be recorded in Atlas and may only be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 162 Td (   made to someone at the same level or above.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 146 Td (4. Operating expenditure and purchase requisitions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 124 Td (Purchase requisitions are raised and approved in Atlas under Atlas > Procurement > Purchase) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 111 Td (Requisition. Approval routes automatically by value.) Tj ET
